{"abstract":"Interaction Design, in an urban context, is an increasingly important field of research. City populations are currently in a state of rapid flux. Conurbations are fast becoming a hybrid of the physical environment and the digital datasphere. How we, as physical beings, will connect with, interpret and adapt this increasing dataflow residing in our cities is already becoming a significant research question. The SIG organisers will frame the discussion through a human–centred view of the concerns, experiences and behaviours that may occur in cities of the future. By adopting an approach of Thinking and Doing it is hoped that the SIG will act as a catalyst for community building.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Smyth, Michael","Helgason, Ingi","Brynskov, Martin","Mitrovic, Ivica","Zaffiro, Gianluca"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-139231"],"event":{"end":"2013-05-02","place":"Paris, fr","start":"2013-04-27","title":"31st Annual CHI Conference on Human Factors in Computing Systems:, CHI EA 2013","year":"2013"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["Croatia","Italy","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Edinburgh Napier University","Telecom Italia","University of Split"],"keyword":["Urban Interaction Design"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"urbanixd designing human interactions in the networked city","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85040709210","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-139231","identifier":[{"id":"85040709210","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-1127d368-528c-4a99-ac8e-fd021f4889c7"],"keyword":["Urban Interaction Design"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-649A5E93F48D9B6A046DD00F9008FE66"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"gb","key":"edinburgh napier university","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"Edinburgh Napier University","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, School of Communication and Culture, Department of Aesthetics and Communication - Study Committee for Information Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"hr","key":"university of split","loc":["Croatia","Europe, EU"],"name":"University of Split","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"it","key":"telecom italia","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Telecom Italia","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Michael","key":"smythpau","last":"Smyth","name":"Smyth, Michael","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ingi","key":"helgasonpau","last":"Helgason","name":"Helgason, Ingi","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Martin","key":"brynskovpau","last":"Brynskov","locid":"b75c46ba-21ca-4810-8424-fcaac7a229b1","name":"Brynskov, Martin","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Ivica","key":"mitrovicpau","last":"Mitrovic","name":"Mitrovic, Ivica","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Gianluca","key":"zaffiropau","last":"Zaffiro","name":"Zaffiro, Gianluca","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Michel","key":"beaudouinlafonpedh","last":"Beaudouin-Lafon","name":"Beaudouin-Lafon, Michel","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Patrick","key":"baudischpedh","last":"Baudisch","name":"Baudisch, Patrick","rank